{"clase": "<p><b>Simulacro del Certamen 2.</b> 4 problemas, como en el C2 2026-1: sensibilidad, Branch and Bound, transporte/transbordo y asignación. Tiempo: <b>80 minutos</b>, sin apuntes. Después corrige con la pauta y anota cuánto te demoraste en cada uno.</p>", "ejemplos": [], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p class=\"src\"><b>Problema 1 (15 pts) · Sensibilidad</b></p><p>Considere el modelo:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 6x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> + 7x<sub>3</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;6x<sub>1</sub> + 3x<sub>2</sub> + 5x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 17<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;5x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 6x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 13<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub>, x<sub>3</sub> ≥ 0</div><p>Holguras: x<sub>4</sub>, x<sub>5</sub> (restricciones 1…2). Tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>4</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Si el coeficiente de x<sub>1</sub> en la función objetivo cambia de 6 a 12, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li><li><b>b)</b> Si b<sub>1</sub> = 26, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima y el nuevo Z?</li><li><b>c)</b> Si se agrega la restricción 5x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 5x<sub>3</sub> ≤ 8, ¿cuál es la nueva solución óptima?</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>a)</h5><p>Nueva función objetivo: Z = 12x<sub>1</sub> + 5x<sub>2</sub> + 7x<sub>3</sub>.</p><p>x<sub>1</sub> es <b>no básica</b>: no hace falta canonizar, solo cambia su costo reducido. En general, el costo reducido nuevo es el anterior − Δc = 4 − (6) = −2.</p><p>Tabla resultante:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Hay costo reducido negativo ⇒ ya no es óptima. Se continúa con <b>simplex primal</b>:</p><p>Entra <b>x<sub>1</sub></b> (costo reducido más negativo = −2). Razones: x<sub>2</sub>: (17/3)/2 = 17/6, x<sub>5</sub>: (5/3)/1 = 5/3. Sale <b>x<sub>5</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>−2</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub> ←</th><td class=\"piv\">1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>20/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>2</td><td>95/3</td><td>Z + 2·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−11/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>−2</td><td>7/3</td><td>F1 − 2·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>F2·1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 5/3, x<sub>2</sub> = 7/3, x<sub>3</sub> = 0; Z = <b>95/3</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>b)</h5><p>x<sub>B</sub> = B⁻¹·b<sub>nuevo</sub>:</p><div class=\"eq\"><span class=\"mat\"><span class=\"mlab\">B⁻¹ =</span><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>1/3</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td></tr></table></span> · <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>13</td></tr></table></span> = <span class=\"mat\"><table class=\"m\"><tr><td>26/3</td></tr><tr><td>−13/3</td></tr></table></span></div><p>(x<sub>B</sub> en el orden de la base: x<sub>2</sub>, x<sub>5</sub>)</p><p>Hay un valor negativo ⇒ la tabla queda <b>infactible</b> (pero sigue cumpliendo optimalidad). Se reemplaza el RHS y se aplica <b>simplex dual</b>:</p><p>Simplex dual: sale <b>x<sub>5</sub></b> (RHS más negativo = −13/3). Cocientes: x<sub>4</sub>: |(5/3)/(−2/3)| = 5/2. Entra <b>x<sub>4</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>4</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>130/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>26/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub> ←</th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td class=\"piv\">−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>−13/3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>13/2</td><td>0</td><td>8</td><td>0</td><td>5/2</td><td>65/2</td><td>Z + 5/2·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>5/2</td><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>13/2</td><td>F1 + 1/2·F2</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>−3/2</td><td>0</td><td>−4</td><td>1</td><td>−3/2</td><td>13/2</td><td>F2·(−3/2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 13/2, x<sub>3</sub> = 0; Z = <b>65/2</b>.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>c)</h5><p>Se evalúa la solución actual: 5x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub> + 5x<sub>3</sub> = 5·0 + 2·17/3 + 5·0 = 34/3.</p><p>34/3 ≤ 8 <b>no se cumple</b>. Se agrega la holgura x<sub>6</sub> y la fila a la tabla óptima:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>4</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>5/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><td>5</td><td>2</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>8</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Se canoniza la nueva fila (dejar 0 bajo las variables básicas):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>4</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>5/3</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>5/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−10/3</td><td>F3 − 2·F1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Simplex dual: sale <b>x<sub>6</sub></b> (RHS más negativo = −10/3). Cocientes: x<sub>4</sub>: |(5/3)/(−2/3)| = 5/2. Entra <b>x<sub>4</sub></b>.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub> ↓</th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>4</td><td>0</td><td>4/3</td><td>5/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>85/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>2</td><td>1</td><td>5/3</td><td>1/3</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>17/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>8/3</td><td>−2/3</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>5/3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>6</sub> ←</th><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>5/3</td><td class=\"piv\">−2/3</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−10/3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>VB</th><th>x<sub>1</sub></th><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><th>x<sub>3</sub></th><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><th>x<sub>6</sub></th><th>RHS</th><th>Operación</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Z</th><td>13/2</td><td>0</td><td>11/2</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>5/2</td><td>20</td><td>Z + 5/2·F3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>2</sub></th><td>5/2</td><td>1</td><td>5/2</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1/2</td><td>4</td><td>F1 + 1/2·F3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>5</sub></th><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>−1</td><td>5</td><td>F2 − F3</td></tr><tr><th>x<sub>4</sub></th><td>−3/2</td><td>0</td><td>−5/2</td><td>1</td><td>0</td><td>−3/2</td><td>5</td><td>F3·(−3/2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Nueva solución:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 0, x<sub>2</sub> = 4, x<sub>3</sub> = 0; Z = <b>20</b> (no mejora, como debe ser).</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p class=\"src\"><b>Problema 2 (15 pts) · Branch and Bound</b></p><p>Considere el modelo de programación lineal entera:</p><div class=\"model\">Max Z = 3x<sub>1</sub> + 2x<sub>2</sub><br>s.a.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;2x<sub>1</sub> − x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;−2x<sub>1</sub> + 7x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 4<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;3x<sub>1</sub> − 2x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 6<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;x<sub>1</sub>, x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 0, enteros</div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Resuelva la relajación lineal mediante el método gráfico.</li><li><b>b)</b> Resuelva el problema entero mediante Branch and Bound (muestre el árbol).</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Relajación lineal (método gráfico)</h5><p>Se grafican las restricciones como igualdades, se sombrea la región factible y se evalúa Z en cada vértice:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 300\" class=\"graph\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Región factible\"><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"34.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"118.7\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"118.7\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"118.7\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"203.3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"203.3\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"203.3\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"288.0\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"288.0\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266.0\" class=\"gr\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"181.3\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"181.3\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"185.3\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"96.7\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"96.7\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"100.7\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"12.0\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"12.0\" class=\"gr\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"16.0\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"328\" y2=\"266\" class=\"axl\"/><line x1=\"34\" y1=\"266\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"12\" class=\"axl\"/><text x=\"326\" y=\"260\" class=\"ax\" text-anchor=\"end\">x₁</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"20\" class=\"ax\">x₂</text><polygon points=\"34.0,266.0 118.7,266.0 161.0,181.3 34.0,217.6\" class=\"reg\"/><line x1=\"118.7\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"245.7\" y2=\"12.0\" class=\"cl c0\"/><text x=\"137.9\" y=\"231.5\" class=\"clab c0\">(1)</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"217.6\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"145.0\" class=\"cl c1\"/><text x=\"114.2\" y=\"191.8\" class=\"clab c1\">(2)</text><line x1=\"203.3\" y1=\"266.0\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"139.0\" class=\"cl c2\"/><text x=\"248.0\" y=\"201.0\" class=\"clab c2\">(3)</text><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"118.7\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"2.2\" class=\"ip\"/><circle cx=\"118.7\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"161.0\" cy=\"181.3\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"266.0\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"34.0\" cy=\"217.6\" r=\"3.2\" class=\"vx\"/><circle cx=\"161.0\" cy=\"181.3\" r=\"6\" class=\"opt\"/><text x=\"169.0\" y=\"173.3\" class=\"olab\">RL (3/2; 1)</text><rect x=\"113.7\" y=\"261.0\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" class=\"iopt\"/><text x=\"126.7\" y=\"280.0\" class=\"ilab\">entera (1; 0)</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th>Vértice (x₁; x₂)</th><th>Z</th><th>Z (decimal)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>(0; 0)</th><td>0</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><th>(0; 4/7)</th><td>8/7</td><td>1,143</td></tr><tr><th>(1; 0)</th><td>3</td><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>(3/2; 1)</th><td>13/2</td><td>6,5</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Óptimo de la RL: x<sub>1</sub> = 3/2 ≈ 1,5, x<sub>2</sub> = 1 ≈ 1, Z = 13/2 ≈ <b>6,5</b>. Es una <b>cota superior</b> para el problema entero.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Branch and Bound</h5><p>Se ramifica la primera variable fraccionaria (x<sub>1</sub> antes que x<sub>2</sub>), explorando primero la rama ≤. Cada nodo se resuelve gráficamente agregando su restricción.</p><div class=\"tree\"><ul><li><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P0</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1,5<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 1<br>Z = 6,5<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≤ 1</div><div class=\"node ram\"><div class=\"nl\">P1</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0,857<br>Z = 4,714<div class=\"tg\">Ramificar</div></div><ul><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≤ 0</div><div class=\"node inc\"><div class=\"nl\">P11</div>x<sub>1</sub> = 1<br>x<sub>2</sub> = 0<br>Z = 3<div class=\"tg\">Entera → incumbente</div></div></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>2</sub> ≥ 1</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P12</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li><li><div class=\"br\">x<sub>1</sub> ≥ 2</div><div class=\"node nf\"><div class=\"nl\">P2</div><b>Infactible</b><div class=\"tg\">Poda: infactible</div></div></li></ul></li></ul></div><p><b>Óptimo entero:</b> x<sub>1</sub> = 1, x<sub>2</sub> = 0, Z = <b>3</b> (nodo P11). Gap = 6,5 − 3 = 3,5.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p class=\"src\"><b>Problema 3 (15 pts) · Transporte</b></p><p>Un fabricante debe enviar todas las unidades de sus bodegas B1 (7) y B2 (5) a los clientes A, B y C, que demandan 8, 2 y 3. Costos unitarios:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td>9</td><td>9</td><td>6</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>2</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>8</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>El cliente B exige toda su demanda. A y C cobran $4 y $7 por cada unidad no entregada.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> SBF inicial por Esquina Nor-Oeste.</li><li><b>b)</b> Solución óptima con el algoritmo de transporte.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Tiene soluciones múltiples? Fundamente.</li><li><b>d)</b> Suponga que desde A y C se pueden enviar unidades a B a $1 y $2. Construya la tabla de transporte.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 12, demanda total = 13. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 1.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td>9</td><td>9</td><td>6</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>2</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>4</td><td>M</td><td>7</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>8</td><td>2</td><td>3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span></td><td class=\"sd\">7</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">5</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">1</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 9·7 + 6·1 + 7·2 + 2·2 + 7·1 = <b>94</b>. Celdas básicas: 5 = m + n − 1 = 3+3−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (3,1) con −7 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (3,1)+ → (3,3)− → (2,3)+ → (2,1)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 1 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,1). Z actual = 94.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">1</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">2</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">1</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">6</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (1,2) con −8 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (1,2)+ → (1,1)− → (3,1)+ → (3,3)− → (2,3)+ → (2,2)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 0 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (3,3). Z actual = 87.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">7</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−8</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−6</span></td><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">2</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">3</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">1</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">0</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">−1</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">2</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,1) con −1 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,1)+ → (2,2)− → (1,2)+ → (1,1)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 2 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,2). Z actual = 87.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">7</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">0</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">2</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">−2</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">8</span></td><td class=\"sd\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">−5</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">9</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 4. Se fija v<sub>1</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 9·5 + 9·2 + 6·2 + 2·3 + 4·1 = <b>85</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">6</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td class=\"sd\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> B1 → A: 5; B1 → B: 2; B2 → A: 2; B2 → C: 3; Fic → A: 1. Z* = <b>85</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>d)</h5><p>A y C pasan a ser nodos de transbordo con B = 13.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t tb\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td>9</td><td>9</td><td>6</td><td class=\"sd\">7</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>2</td><td class=\"sd\">5</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>4</td><td>M</td><td>7</td><td class=\"sd\">1</td></tr><tr><th>A</th><td>0</td><td>1</td><td>M</td><td class=\"sd\">0+13</td></tr><tr><th>C</th><td>M</td><td>2</td><td>0</td><td class=\"sd\">0+13</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">8+13</td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"sd\">3+13</td><td class=\"sd\">39</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"chk\">Costo mínimo de esta tabla: 81.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p class=\"src\"><b>Problema 4 (15 pts) · Asignación</b></p><p>Asignar cuatro operadores a cuatro máquinas. El operador 1 no puede ir a la máquina 3 y el operador 3 no puede ir a la máquina 4. Costos:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Máq1</th><th>Máq2</th><th>Máq3</th><th>Máq4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Op1</th><td>8</td><td>8</td><td>–</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><th>Op2</th><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>7</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><th>Op3</th><td>8</td><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>–</td></tr><tr><th>Op4</th><td>7</td><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>9</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Hay una quinta máquina con costos 1, 3, 6, 8 para los operadores 1 a 4.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Encuentre la asignación óptima.</li><li><b>b)</b> Construya la tabla con la quinta máquina y resuélvala. ¿Conviene reemplazar una máquina? ¿Cuál?</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>a)</h5><p><b>Paso 1a:</b> a cada fila se le resta su menor valor (entre paréntesis):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"ht\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"\">Máq1</th><th class=\"\">Máq2</th><th class=\"\">Máq3</th><th class=\"\">Máq4</th><th class=\"pen\">mín</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th class=\"\">Op1</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"pen\">(6)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op2</th><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"pen\">(4)</td></tr><tr><th class=\"\">Op3</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\">M</td><td 